            "value": "In your phone company's app, open **Profile** or **Account**. Check the email and phone number on file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.carrier_account.step.unique_pw": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In your phone company's own app, look under **Profile** or **Security** for **Password**. Use one you use nowhere else, saved in the **Passwords** app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.carrier_account.where": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in with your phone company's own app or website. Never use a link from a text. The Phone number lock item below is part of this too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.carrier_account.why.recovery_info": {
      "comment": "Why line under an online-account step (ServiceStepsScreen).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The phone company tells you about account changes here, so a change you didn't make won't go unnoticed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.carrier_account.why.unique_pw": {
      "comment": "Why line under an online-account step (ServiceStepsScreen).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Someone in your phone company account could move your number to their phone and get your sign-in codes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.cash_app.name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cash App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.cash_app.step.2fa": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Cash App, tap your profile icon → **Security** → **Security Lock**. Turn it on for **Sending payments**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.cash_app.step.alerts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap your profile icon → **Notifications**. Turn on alerts for every payment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.cash_app.step.recovery_info": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap your profile icon and check the phone number and email listed. Fix any that are wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.cash_app.where": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the app: Profile → Security"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.cash_app.why.2fa": {
      "comment": "Why line under an online-account step (ServiceStepsScreen).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If someone picks up your unlocked phone, they still can't send money from Cash App."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.cash_app.why.alerts": {
      "comment": "Why line under an online-account step (ServiceStepsScreen).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Money sent through an app is hard to get back. An alert lets you act within minutes if a payment wasn't you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_bureaus.name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Credit bureaus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_bureaus.step.unique_pw": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you made accounts with the credit bureaus, give each one its own password, saved in the **Passwords** app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_bureaus.where": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each bureau has its own website: Equifax, Experian and TransUnion. The three Freeze items below are part of this too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_bureaus.why.unique_pw": {
      "comment": "Why line under an online-account step (ServiceStepsScreen).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your bureau account can lift your credit freeze. Its own password keeps the freeze in place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_card.name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your credit card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_card.step.2fa": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In your card's app (or your bank's app), open **Settings** or **Profile** → **Security**. Turn on two-step sign-in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_card.step.alerts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the card's app, open **Alerts**. Turn on an alert for every purchase, even small ones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_card.step.recovery_info": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the card's app, open **Profile** or **Settings**. Check the phone number and email on file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_card.step.sessions": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the card's app, look under **Security** for a list of devices. Remove any that aren't yours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_card.where": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open your bank's own app, then Settings → Security and Alerts. Never use a link from a text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.credit_card.why.alerts": {
      "comment": "Why line under an online-account step (ServiceStepsScreen).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Criminals often test a stolen card with a tiny charge first. An alert for every purchase catches it early."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.facebook.name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Facebook"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.facebook.step.2fa": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the Facebook app, tap **Menu** → **Settings & privacy** → **Settings** → **Accounts Center** → **Password and security** → **Two-factor authentication**. Pick your account and follow the steps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.facebook.step.alerts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In **Accounts Center** → **Password and security** → **Login alerts**. Turn them on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.facebook.step.checkup": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In **Accounts Center** → **Password and security** → **Security Checkup**. Follow each suggestion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service.facebook.step.recovery_info": {
