            "value": "Open the Gmail app → tap your photo (top right) → **Manage your Google Account** → **Security & sign-in** (some phones say **Security**). Under **How you sign in to Google**, tap **2-Step Verification** and follow the steps. You can add a **passkey** there too."
          }
